    treePath: 'Resources/GameMode/CardGames/Games/race/fast-track/fast-trackRules.asset',
    gameId: 'fast-track',
    icon: '🃏',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Turn Sequence**: On your turn, play one card from your hand to move a marble. Draw one card from your deck to return to 5-card hand (unless the card says 'Play Again'). 2. **Exiting the Pen**: You can only move a marble OUT of the Holding Pen with specific 'Start' cards (Joker, Ace, King, Queen, Jack, or 6). These cards can also move your marble forward that many spaces. 3. **Forward Movement**: Play a card matching its number value. Face cards (K, Q, J) can move 10 spaces or exit the Pen. 4. **Backwards Movement (4s)**: The 4 is unique: play a 4 to move a marble BACKWARD 4 spaces. This is a powerful defensive move. 5. **Split Movement (7s)**: Play a 7 to move a single marble 7 spaces OR split the 7 between two different marbles (e.g., 3+4 or 2+5). 6. **Joker (Trump Card)**: Move a marble to any opponent's exact position (bumping them back to their Holding Pen) OR use as a Start card. Play Again. 7. **Play Again Cards**: Aces, 6s, Face Cards, and Jokers grant an extra turn (draw card, take another turn). 8. **Landing on Fast Track**: If you land exactly on a Fast Track entry space, you may use the central shortcut on your next turn to jump across the board.",
    Player: "1. **Turn Sequence**: On your turn, play one card from your hand to move a marble. Draw one card from your deck to return to 5-card hand (unless the card says 'Play Again'). 2. **Exiting the Pen**: You can only move a marble OUT of the Holding Pen with specific 'Start' cards (Joker, Ace, King, Queen, Jack, or 6). These cards can also move your marble forward that many spaces. 3. **Forward Movement**: Play a card matching its number value. Face cards (K, Q, J) can move 10 spaces or exit the Pen. 4. **Backwards Movement (4s)**: The 4 is unique: play a 4 to move a marble BACKWARD 4 spaces. This is a powerful defensive move. 5. **Split Movement (7s)**: Play a 7 to move a single marble 7 spaces OR split the 7 between two different marbles (e.g., 3+4 or 2+5). 6. **Joker (Trump Card)**: Move a marble to any opponent's exact position (bumping them back to their Holding Pen) OR use as a Start card. Play Again. 7. **Play Again Cards**: Aces, 6s, Face Cards, and Jokers grant an extra turn (draw card, take another turn). 8. **Landing on Fast Track**: If you land exactly on a Fast Track entry space, you may use the central shortcut on your next turn to jump across the board.",
    objective: 'Be the first player or team to move all 4 marbles from the Holding Pen around the board and into your Home Base (center area).',
    gameplay: "1. **Turn Sequence**: On your turn, play one card from your hand to move a marble. Draw one card from your deck to return to 5-card hand (unless the card says 'Play Again'). 2. **Exiting the Pen**: You can only move a marble OUT of the Holding Pen with specific 'Start' cards (Joker, Ace, King, Queen, Jack, or 6). These cards can also move your marble forward that many spaces. 3. **Forward Movement**: Play a card matching its number value. Face cards (K, Q, J) can move 10 spaces or exit the Pen. 4. **Backwards Movement (4s)**: The 4 is unique: play a 4 to move a marble BACKWARD 4 spaces. This is a powerful defensive move. 5. **Split Movement (7s)**: Play a 7 to move a single marble 7 spaces OR split the 7 between two different marbles (e.g., 3+4 or 2+5). 6. **Joker (Trump Card)**: Move a marble to any opponent's exact position (bumping them back to their Holding Pen) OR use as a Start card. Play Again. 7. **Play Again Cards**: Aces, 6s, Face Cards, and Jokers grant an extra turn (draw card, take another turn). 8. **Landing on Fast Track**: If you land exactly on a Fast Track entry space, you may use the central shortcut on your next turn to jump across the board.",
    keyRules: [
      "**Bumping**: If you land exactly on a space occupied by an opponent's marble, that opponent's marble returns to their Holding Pen.",
      "**Fast Track Shortcut**: A dangerous shortcut across the board's center. Easy bumping target but saves many spaces.",
      '**Blocking**: You cannot pass your own marbles. If a marble blocks your path, choose a different marble to move.',
      '**Must Move**: If you have a legal move, you MUST take it, even if disadvantageous.',
      '**Card Values**: 2-10 move forward that many spaces. J, Q, K = 10 spaces or Start. Ace = 1 space or Start. 6 = 6 spaces or Start and Play Again. 4 = Move backward 4 spaces. 7 = Move 7 spaces or split between two marbles. Joker = Trump (bump opponent or Start) + Play Again.',
      '**Home Base Entry**: Only certain positions allow entry into Home Base; marbles must enter from the correct position on the track.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: '2 to 6 players (can be played in teams with partners sitting opposite each other on a square board).',
      deck: 'Each player (or team) has their own full 52-card deck PLUS 2 Jokers (54 cards total per player deck). Keep decks separated by player.',
      equipment: '1. **Fast Track Board**: Hexagonal or square board with 64-68 spaces around the perimeter plus 4 Home Base centers (one per player/team). 2. **Marbles or Pegs**: 4 marbles per player in their color. 3. **Holding Pen**: Off-board area where marbles start before being entered into play.',
      dealing: 'Each player shuffles their own deck and draws 5 cards into their starting hand. Place remaining cards face-down as draw pile.',
    },
    turnFlow: "1. **Turn Sequence**: On your turn, play one card from your hand to move a marble. Draw one card from your deck to return to 5-card hand (unless the card says 'Play Again'). 2. **Exiting the Pen**: You can only move a marble OUT of the Holding Pen with specific 'Start' cards (Joker, Ace, King, Queen, Jack, or 6). These cards can also move your marble forward that many spaces. 3. **Forward Movement**: Play a card matching its number value. Face cards (K, Q, J) can move 10 spaces or exit the Pen. 4. **Backwards Movement (4s)**: The 4 is unique: play a 4 to move a marble BACKWARD 4 spaces. This is a powerful defensive move. 5. **Split Movement (7s)**: Play a 7 to move a single marble 7 spaces OR split the 7 between two different marbles (e.g., 3+4 or 2+5). 6. **Joker (Trump Card)**: Move a marble to any opponent's exact position (bumping them back to their Holding Pen) OR use as a Start card. Play Again. 7. **Play Again Cards**: Aces, 6s, Face Cards, and Jokers grant an extra turn (draw card, take another turn). 8. **Landing on Fast Track**: If you land exactly on a Fast Track entry space, you may use the central shortcut on your next turn to jump across the board.",
